Wow. A YAAD story shortly after my Wizard YASD. The RNG must either 
really hate me, or really love me in a very abusive way.

Okay, this time I decided to play as a Knight. After finding some speed 
boots in a DL2 shop, I found the entrance to the Gnomish Mines on DL3. 
I didn't know it at the time, but the game loaded bones there. Upon 
making a return trip to try and scrounge up some mithril, I walked a 
short distance from the upstair and saw A Torn Quad's ghost. As I was 
moving to leave that alcove, a water demon zapped a wand of cold at me! 
I started bolting for the upstair at that point, and I made it... just 
in time to get zapped AGAIN, survive the first hit, and get killed by 
the rebound.

If anyone encounters some bones on the first Mines level with a /oCold-
wielding water demon within a few spaces of the upstair... I'm sorry. I 
did the best I could to escape that level.

